  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2b58a9b0d0605badfc6c00a4809e6a79615835e526bf0ff5e862b72e292fe1d",
      "text": "漫画App广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c3ed5532eed508aa29231bfd419a14c3f2e98403091938c38166ec5d73e5ed",
      "text": "哇，居然是这种展开？\n接下来会变成怎样啊……这家伙到底……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d75caac1629a6119d96afae2e3021813be8d970c90240122c0d6ace7107cb9eb",
      "text": "秀先生，马上就要开始拍摄了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8784b6dc61b268919790f123bde493e4d9103d85bd325cebf5f35c0f8291c932",
      "text": "……嗯？●●●●プロデューサー。\n已经到时间了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10133c73f7829e49012f9f76d11b55ff56b877bca285727462a9d27b34b5a489",
      "text": "您看手机看得非常入迷呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e0823c9e7534d543871fd574829bc0abb862c9f065a1b33a7d5590703bf2a17",
      "text": "我想着拍摄前先确认一下，就看了漫画App。\n每部都挺有意思的，不知不觉就看入迷了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07bdeda19d9c1d89cf191bac22c73a20cb226a74c5d681c7f86d9500ea5f976f",
      "text": "特别是这部漫画，意料之外的发展接二连三，\n根本停不下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6fe29cb752aecb1b3198840996ca9adee3c501881499e3f2804d8323433ed41",
      "text": "这边的这部新作漫画，角色也很有个性，\n感觉人气应该能更高一点才对。……啊，对哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e60e100180d6f0962b812014f1e7a34eeb8351d4cfb3bd380f45c2101dc1f24",
      "text": "只要我拍了广告，大家就会知道这个App，\n那样一来，看这部漫画的人自然也会变多吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f23bdf1874021415a5feb507c0ef680e375a3dc6d9152af1ba6ed49705b239",
      "text": "是啊，看到秀先生出演的广告，\n大家肯定都会去看漫画的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_047shu_1_5_047_04:1_5_047_04:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a0ec9a3896e3472043d7de581f381621fc7161f2264295e3e73425a59f66ea5",
      "text": "就是说嘛。……嗯，干劲上来了。\n制作人，快点去录影棚吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
